🎉 Crafty Cats Campaign! 🎉
Take your mind off the summer heat by crafting up a Battle Cats creation! The Crafty Cats art contest is on between August 1st (12:00AM PDT) and August 28th, 2023 (11:59PM PDT).<br>
Create an original work of physical craft art inspired by The Battle Cats (costumes, cakes, dolls clay models, sculptures... any three-dimensional physical art is okay!) and upload a photo of your creation as a comment to this page, along with the tag #CraftyBattleCats!

We'll check out all your fantastic creations and announce winners on August 31st, 2023! For more details, check the webpage below:<br>
https://battlecats.club/en/special/craft/craft_2023_en.html

🎁 We will choose our favorites from among the entries to showcase on the official contest webpage and social media sites, and award prizes to a few lucky artists! Chosen artists could win:<br>
🥇 Gold Prize: One 1000 Cat Food Prize Winner<br>
🥈 Silver Prize: Three 500 Cat Food Prize Winners<br>
🥉 Bronze Prize: Ten 300 Cat Food Prize Winners

🎁 Plus, if the LIKES, COMMENTS and SHARES on offical posts with the #CraftyBattleCats tag reach 20000 in total, every Battle Cats player will earn a Rare Ticket gift!

Create a piece of physical craft art in any medium: dolls, costumes, cakes, clay models, sculptures... anything is okay!

We will not be acceptiing the following forms of artwork as entries for this contest:<br>
✖ 2D illustrations or digital art<br>
✖ Artwork featuring collab characters or containing images borrowed from other IPs

Although you are welcome to enter multiple pieces of art into this contest, please do not post the same piece multiple times! Spamming isn't nice!

When you post your art, please:<br>
・Include your Facebook display name/Facebook ID as a watermark, or on a piece of paper shown in the image!<br>
・Include the title of your artwork in the text body of your submission comment.<br>
Doing the above will help us identify selected art clearly and give proper attribution to the creator!

💡 Please read the information page on the official #CraftyBattleCats contest website (https://battlecats.club/en/special/craft/craft 2023 en.html) before you submit your entry to the Crafty Cats contest!

We can't wait to see what creative wonders you come up with!

